{"id": "x005-006", "text": "Aoife has her viva on 2 November 2026. v nervous, barely sleeping, says her supervisor keeps changing what chapter 4 shd look like. her partner Milan is taking the day off to be there after. text her good luck the night b4 and maybe drop round some of those lemon biscuits she likes", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aoife", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viva", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "barely sleeping", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "supervisor", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night b4", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some of those lemon biscuits she likes", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "lemon biscuits", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x005-012", "text": "Matilda failed her theory test again :( 3rd time. she feels rubbish about it, kept saying she's just thick which she isnt. check in w/ her this wk and maybe offer to go thru the hazard perception stuff together", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "theory test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rubbish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in w/ her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this wk", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to go thru the hazard perception stuff together", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
