{"id": "x005-044", "text": "Ines's daughter Sofia had her ballet grade 3 exam this morning, came out in tears thinking she'd messed up the turns. results in abt 6 wks so a long wait. her little brother has his first swimming gala on sat too and ines is doing both on her own while her husband's away. should check in w/ ines tmrw", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ballet grade 3 exam", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in tears", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in abt 6 wks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little brother", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first swimming gala", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ines", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in w/ ines", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ines", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "tmrw", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x005-049", "text": "long call w/ Jess. her dad's retiring end of march 2027 after 35 yrs at the council and they want to throw a do for him, prob 2nd of april. she's also halfway thru her masters, dissertation due 1 Sept, and finding it a lot on top of work. her cat Mochi needs teeth out at the vet next wk too, poor thing. remind me to send her the details of that tutor", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of march 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "35 yrs at the council", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2nd of april", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "halfway thru her masters", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dissertation", "event_type": "school", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "1 Sept", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "finding it a lot", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Mochi", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "teeth out at the vet", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next wk", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her the details of that tutor", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "tutor"}]}
